 in a 3-2-4-1: a team sheet is a starting point, not a contract. On paper, {T:away:sub} lined up in a 4-3-3. On the pitch, in possession, it looked more like a 3-4-3.","keys":["{T:home:sub} changes shape by phase: 3-2-4-1 with the ball, 4-3-3 without.","{T:away:sub} changes shape by phase: 3-4-3 with the ball, 3-2-3-2 without.","{T:home:pos} favourite lane: the left wing (27% of touches).","{T:away:pos} favourite lane: the right wing (26% of touches).","{T:away:sub} camped in the opponent's half: 31% of touches in the final third."],"impact":"Out of possession, {T:away:sub} defended higher (back line 29.2 m from goal, against 24.0 m; tournament average: 28.4 m). Defend high and win: the line held, and so did the gamble."}},"s3":{"fr":{"lead":"Le pressing, c'était {T:home:sub} : un PPDA de 13,8, contre 30,8 en face. Comprendre : moins de passes laissées à l'adversaire avant de lui sauter dessus.","keys":["Réaction à la perte comparable : 26 % et 25 % des ballons perdus récupérés en moins de 5 s.","15 récupérations hautes pour {T:away:sub} (ballons perdus par l'adversaire dans ses 35 derniers mètres) : autant de départs d'actions à deux pas du but."],"impact":"Presser ne suffit pas : encore faut-il que les ballons récupérés se transforment. Ici, ils ne l'ont pas fait."},"en":{"lead":"The pressing came from {T:home:sub}: a PPDA of 13.8, against 30.8 for the opponents. Translation: fewer passes allowed before jumping on the ball.","keys":["Similar reaction to losing the ball: 26% and 25% won back within 5 s.","15 high regains for {T:away:sub} (balls lost by the opponent in their own 35 metres): that many attacks starting next to goal."],"impact":"Pressing is not enough: the regained balls still have to turn into something. Here, they did not."}},"s4":{"fr":{"lead":"Choc des philosophies : {T:away:sub} (−0,17) jouait autour du ballon, {T:home:sub} (−0,79) tenait ses postes.","keys":["{T:home:Sub} : 43 % de passes courtes (moins de 15 m), contre 53 % en moyenne.","Le carrefour du réseau {T:home:de} : Morteza Pouraliganji, impliqué dans 93 passes entre titulaires.","Le carrefour du réseau {T:away:de} : Tyler Adams, impliqué dans 102 passes entre titulaires."],"impact":"Et cette fois, c'est le football relationniste qui l'emporte. Ce n'est pas une loi, c'est un match."},"en":{"lead":"Clash of philosophies: {T:away:sub} (−0.17) played around the ball, {T:home:sub} (−0.79) held their positions.","keys":["{T:home:sub}: 43% short passes (under 15 m), against 53% on average.","The hub of {T:home:pos} network: Morteza Pouraliganji, involved in 93 passes between starters.","The hub of {T:away:pos} network: Tyler Adams, involved in 102 passes between starters."],"impact":"And this time, relational football wins. It is not a law, it is a match."}},"s5":{"fr":{"lead":"Transitions sous contrôle des deux côtés : 1 tir(s) concédé(s) après une perte pour {T:home:sub}, 1 pour {T:away:sub}.","keys":["{T:home:Sub} : 4,4 joueurs derrière le ballon à la perte, 4,6 quelques secondes plus tard ; bloc reformé (7 joueurs ou plus) dans 23 % des cas.","{T:away:Sub} : 5,0 joueurs derrière le ballon à la perte, 5,4 quelques secondes plus tard ; bloc reformé (7 joueurs ou plus) dans 27 % des cas."],"impact":"Personne n'a été puni en transition : le match s'est joué en attaque placée."},"en":{"lead":"Transitions under control on both sides: 1 shot(s) conceded after a loss for {T:home:sub}, 1 for {T:away:sub}.","keys":["{T:home:sub}: 4.4 players behind the ball at the loss, 4.6 a few seconds later; block rebuilt (7+ players) in 23% of cases.","{T:away:sub}: 5.0 players behind the ball at the loss, 5.4 a few seconds later; block rebuilt (7+ players) in 27% of cases."],"impact":"Nobody got punished in transition: the match was decided in settled play."}},"s6":{"fr":{"lead":"Mehdi Taremi avait un fan-club, et il portait le maillot adverse : 0,89 adversaire par touche de plus que la normale, dans les 10 m.","keys":["Sardar Azmoun ({T:home:bare}) : +0,79.","Ahmad Nouro